  "extractionNotes": "Employment ended 2025-07-31 by agreement under the collective-redundancy act because the employer was liquidated; ZAS-55 filed online on 2025-07-28 (before the end of employment) with the declaration that no other employment was offered. ZUS asked for a Z-10 (sickness after employment) as well; the claimant explained twice that she claims only the art. 30 benefit. Handwritten ZUS note: right granted from 2025-08-01 until the day of birth. Benefit screen: row from 2025-08-01 at 100%, its end equal to the screen query date 2025-11-03 (95 days), i.e. open until the birth. Birth date not in the file: the register shows a first 1240 row from 2025-08-01 (end truncated) and a new 1240 row from 2025-10-15, read as the switch to maternity benefit at the birth; event.date and the benefit end are inferred from it. Pregnancy certificate is mostly illegible (pregnancy during employment inferred). Title start 2013-08-01 on the Z-3, 2017-10-01 in the register (anonymisation inconsistency); Z-3 used. Salary table 2024-01..2024-12 (12 months before the first incapacity in 2025-01): fixed 13425.76 then 14097.06 from 2024-04, variable 8458.23 (2024-03) and 700.00 (2024-12); 2024-02 and 2024-10 have sickness days. Employer reported more than 20 insured and paid the sickness benefit itself. asOf = query date of the ZUS screens carrying the grant note."
